   "text": "D3SCOPE scope for this example: core = area/line + time scale, donut/pie + legend, sparkline, tooltip/crosshair,\nchart.update(data), locale-aware formatting (fr-FR default, configurable), light theme tokens (dark in v2).\nCore plugins = treemap, brush.   Finance plugin (separate repo) = candlestick + finance helpers.\nEverything grey (navigation, KPIs, tables, settings UI) belongs to the app, not to the library.",
   "originalText": "D3SCOPE scope for this example: core = area/line + time scale, donut/pie + legend, sparkline, tooltip/crosshair,\nchart.update(data), locale-aware formatting (fr-FR default, configurable), light theme tokens (dark in v2).\nCore plugins = treemap, brush.   Finance plugin (separate repo) = candlestick + finance helpers.\nEverything grey (navigation, KPIs, tables, settings UI) belongs to the app, not to the library.",
